  "instruction": "Open VSCode with ~/projects/go-grpc-gateway. Set up a gRPC-Gateway to expose gRPC as REST: (1) Install grpc-gateway and buf: 'go get github.com/grpc-ecosystem/grpc-gateway/v2'. (2) Update proto/user.proto to add google.api.http annotations: map GetUser to GET /v1/users/{id}, ListUsers to GET /v1/users, CreateUser to POST /v1/users. (3) Regenerate gRPC and gateway code: add a buf.gen.yaml for go, go-grpc, and grpc-gateway plugins. (4) Create cmd/gateway/main.go setting up both a gRPC server (port 9090) and an HTTP/REST gateway server (port 8080) using grpc-gateway's runtime.NewServeMux(). (5) Create cmd/gateway/main.go with runtime.NewServeMux() that transcodes HTTP to gRPC. (6) Add Makefile targets: proto-gen, run-grpc, run-gateway. Create .vscode/tasks.json with the targets.",
